c Three-coloring a triangle (K3)
c Variables: x_vc means vertex v has color c
c v1: vars 1,2,3 (colors R,G,B)
c v2: vars 4,5,6
c v3: vars 7,8,9
c Each vertex has at least one color
c Each vertex has at most one color (pairwise)
c Adjacent vertices have different colors
c This is SAT - K3 is 3-colorable
p cnf 9 21
c vertex 1 has at least one color
1 2 3 0
c vertex 2 has at least one color
4 5 6 0
c vertex 3 has at least one color
7 8 9 0
c vertex 1 has at most one color
-1 -2 0
-1 -3 0
-2 -3 0
c vertex 2 has at most one color
-4 -5 0
-4 -6 0
-5 -6 0
c vertex 3 has at most one color
-7 -8 0
-7 -9 0
-8 -9 0
c edge v1-v2: different colors
-1 -4 0
-2 -5 0
-3 -6 0
c edge v1-v3: different colors
-1 -7 0
-2 -8 0
-3 -9 0
c edge v2-v3: different colors
-4 -7 0
-5 -8 0
-6 -9 0
